{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"agnostic","version":"v0","id":"guides/docs-agents","title":"Run docs stages on chosen models","description":"Install Claude Code subagents that run each jf-docs stage on its own model, with Codex reviewing.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The docs skills name no model, so every stage runs on whatever model your session\nuses. The package also ships three Claude Code subagents that pin a model and\nreasoning effort to each stage, and hand review to Codex so a different model\nchecks the writer's work."]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["In this guide you will:"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["See which agent runs each stage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Install the agents in a project or for your user."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Tell Claude Code to delegate each stage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":["Understand what happens when Codex is unavailable."]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"choose-the-agents"},"children":["Choose the agents"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:table","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Agent"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Stages"]},{"tag":"th","props":{},"children":["Model and effort"]}]]}]},{"tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["docs-analyzer"]}]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs-analyze"]},", ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs-plan"]}]]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Claude Opus, high"]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["docs-writer"]}]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs-write"]},", including fixes from review"]]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":["Claude Sonnet, medium"]}]]},{"tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["docs-reviewer"]}]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs-review"]}]},{"tag":"td","props":{},"children":[["Codex ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["gpt-6.2-astra"]},", high, read-only"]]}]]}]]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["jf-docs"]}," itself stays in your main session and decides which stages a task needs.\nEach agent reads the docs skills from your project, so install all six docs skills\nfirst, as ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"../installation.md"},"children":["Installation"]}," describes."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"install-the-agents"},"children":["Install the agents"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["The agents are Markdown files under ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["agents/claude/"]}," in the published package. Add\nthe package as a development dependency:"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabs","props":{"defaultValue":"npm","groupId":"package-manager","persist":true},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabsList","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabsTrigger","props":{"value":"npm"},"children":["npm"]},{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabsTrigger","props":{"value":"pnpm"},"children":["pnpm"]},{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabsTrigger","props":{"value":"yarn"},"children":["yarn"]},{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTabsTrigger","props":{"value":"bun"},"children":["bun"]}]]},{"tag":"mdx:CodeBlockTab","props":{"value":"npm"},"children":[{"tag":"mdx:pre","props":{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m 4,4 a 1,1 0 0 0 -0.7070312,0.2929687 1,1 0 0 0 0,1.4140625 L 8.5859375,11 3.2929688,